      <script type='application/ld+json'>{"@context": "http://schema.org", "@id": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20008699", "@type": "https://schema.org/Dataset", "author": [{"@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1567-6508", "@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Calfa / Ecole nationale des Chartes-PSL"}], "familyName": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne", "givenName": "Chahan", "name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne, Chahan"}, {"@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "GREgORI / Universit\u00e9 de Louvain"}], "familyName": "Kindt", "givenName": "Bastien", "name": "Kindt, Bastien"}], "contentSize": "501.85 MB", "creator": [{"@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1567-6508", "@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Calfa / Ecole nationale des Chartes-PSL"}], "familyName": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne", "givenName": "Chahan", "name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne, Chahan"}, {"@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "GREgORI / Universit\u00e9 de Louvain"}], "familyName": "Kindt", "givenName": "Bastien", "name": "Kindt, Bastien"}], "dateCreated": "2026-05-03T16:14:28.956127+00:00", "dateModified": "2026-05-03T16:14:29.244564+00:00", "datePublished": "2026-04", "description": "\u003cp\u003eGround truth manually produced within the scope of the CGPG project (Calfa GREgORI Patrologia Graeca), led by Jean-Marie Auwers (UCLouvain), that aim to OCRize the remaining non-digital versions of the Patrologia Graeca volumes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eV1 dataset\u003c/strong\u003e compiles annotations from 2021 to 2022, and has been used for the Programming Historian online lesson \u003ca href=\"https://programminghistorian.org/fr/lecons/transcription-automatisee-graphies-non-latines\"\u003e\"Transcription automatis\u0026eacute;e de graphies non latines\"\u003c/a\u003e. The dataset contains a set of 100 images from the Patrologia Graeca, with their corresponding pageXML files. Annotation has been performed with the \u003ca href=\"https://vision.calfa.fr\"\u003eCalfa Vision platform\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDifferent level of annotations are proposed to overcome two tasks: (task1) detection of text regions in Greek (annotations at the region level only) and (task 2) recognition of ancient polytonic Greek (annotations at the line level).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask 1:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ecol_greek: 52\u003cbr\u003ecol_lat: 54\u003cbr\u003efootnotes: 27\u003cbr\u003etitles: 9\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask 2:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003elines: 2.579\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinal model of layout analysis is freely usable on the \u003ca href=\"https://vision.calfa.fr\"\u003eCalfa Vision platform\u003c/a\u003e, by choosing the \"Greek printed (Patrologia Graeca)\" type of project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eV2 dataset\u003c/strong\u003e contains the full training set used for processing the PG. It contains 304 image + pageXML pairs, annotated with the Calfa Vision platform.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe project is sponsored by the ASBL \u003cem\u003eByzantion\u003c/em\u003e, the Fondation \u003cem\u003eSedes Sapientiae\u003c/em\u003e, the Institut \u003cem\u003eReligions, Spiritualit\u0026eacute;s, Cultures, Soci\u0026eacute;t\u0026eacute;s\u003c/em\u003e (RSCS, UCLouvain) and the \u003cem\u003eCentre d\u0027\u0026eacute;tudes orientales\u003c/em\u003e (CIOL, UCLouvain) and by a generous donor who wishes to remain anonymous. Other sponsors have recently expressed their willingness to support the project.\u003c/p\u003e", "distribution": [{"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20008699/files/data-v2.zip/content", "encodingFormat": "application/zip"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20008699/files/data.zip/content", "encodingFormat": "application/zip"}], "editor": [{"@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Universit\u00e9 de Louvain"}], "familyName": "Auwers", "givenName": "Jean-Marie", "name": "Auwers, Jean-Marie"}, {"@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1567-6508", "@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Calfa / Ecole nationale des Chartes-PSL"}], "familyName": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne", "givenName": "Chahan", "name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne, Chahan"}, {"@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "GREgORI / Universit\u00e9 de Louvain"}], "familyName": "Kindt", "givenName": "Bastien", "name": "Kindt, Bastien"}, {"@type": "Person", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Universit\u00e9 de Louvain"}], "familyName": "Somers", "givenName": "V\u00e9ronique", "name": "Somers, V\u00e9ronique"}], "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20008699", "keywords": "dataset, ocr, Patrologia Graeca, layout analysis", "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode", "name": "Patrologia Graeca (OCR ground truth)", "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Zenodo"}, "size": "501.85 MB", "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/20008699"}</script>

